# Project: Hosted AI Voice-to-Voice Companion (cs576 group 10)

## Goal
An AI voice-to-voice companion. No local models: every AI step (speech-to-text, chat, embeddings) runs on a hosted API. ElevenLabs provides TTS. Avatar/lipsync rendering is out of scope for now (see TBD).

